  _storyBody: 'A food-safety scare has just torn through the B1 food court.


    You
    were lucky - you skipped the buffet. Now people are rushing for the restrooms,
    and nobody knows the way.


    Someone hands you the floor map. Guide everyone
    to the restroom before time runs out.'
